# BELLHOP: the code screen. BREW-ROOM plays the five crystal rooms by
# themselves, one after another, with crystals worth 100 instead of 200.
# A run with a code on earns no goals and leaves the records alone.
seed 1
game bellhop
wait 20
press DOWN
wait 5
press A
wait 10
expect state == 1
